i"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-spectrum.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x180","subtitle":"The signature device: hard-stop cyan / magenta / yellow / ink. Once per section, never blended.","name":"Spectrum rule"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-wordmark.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"No logo file was supplied — the mark is type-set. Replace with assets/logo.svg when available.","name":"Wordmark (placeholder)"},{"path":"guidelines/color-gamut.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Cyan / magenta / yellow — the print-process accents. Graphic and category use; -700 steps carry text.","name":"Process gamut"},{"path":"guidelines/color-ink.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Warm-neutral greys — the structural colour of every surface, border and text style.","name":"Ink neutrals"},{"path":"guidelines/color-pairings.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x240","subtitle":"Approved text/background combinations with measured contrast ratios.","name":"Accessible pairings"},{"path":"guidelines/color-paper.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Three page grounds. Alternate paper and paper-warm; sunken is for inset panels.","name":"Paper surfaces"},{"path":"guidelines/color-signal-red.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"The single brand accent. 600 and darker are safe for text and fills on paper.","name":"Signal Red"},{"path":"guidelines/color-status.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Four fg/bg pairs for feedback. Foregrounds all clear 4.5:1 on their own background.","name":"Semantic status"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x330","subtitle":"Buttons, icon buttons, badges, tags, wordmark, spectrum rule","name":"Core"},{"path":"components/feedback/feedback.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x380","subtitle":"Alerts, toast, tooltip, progress, spinner, dialog","name":"Feedback"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.ca